=== tng_email 00000000-0000-80b3-8c56-6d41b85ab9c6 Captain's Log — Stardate 80124.1
--- 019b98c1-db00-89bf-8e74-14d9155da327
Jean-Luc Picard <picard@enterprise.starfleet> to Starfleet Command <command@starfleet.gov>; bcc Deanna Troi <troi@enterprise.starfleet> — Wed 7 Jan 2026 14:00

Labels: Important, Sent

Captain's log, stardate 80124.1. The Enterprise has arrived at the
Neutral Zone. Long-range scans have detected three Romulan warbirds
holding position at the edge of sensor range. I have ordered yellow
alert and dispatched a coded message to Starfleet Command.

We continue our investigation.

— Picard

